# 其他人工智能 / Other AI
# Maintainer: LouieLumi
# Updated: 2026-09-23
# Rules: 130
# Policy-free Surge RULE-SET. Edit this file directly; no regeneration is required.
# Scope, verified sources and limitations: docs/OTHER_AI.md; docs/other-ai-audit.json.
# Original sources: OtherAI.list, OpenAI.list and Proxy.list in this repository.
# Entries migrated from the blackmatrix7-derived Proxy list retain their GPL-2.0 attribution.
# Upstream: https://github.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script and its credited contributors.
# See LICENSES/GPL-2.0.txt and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for those migrated entries.
# Cloudflare service domains are routed here by user request; see docs/CLOUDFLARE.md.

# Cloudflare services and provider-hosted endpoints (not the whole AS13335 network).
# Covers the website, API, Turnstile, cdnjs and STUN/TURN via cloudflare.com.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloudflare.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloudflare-dns.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloudflare-ipfs.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloudflarestatus.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloudflareinsights.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloudflareclient.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloudflare-gateway.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloudflareaccess.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,workers.dev
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pages.dev
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,r2.cloudflarestorage.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,r2.dev
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,argotunnel.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cfargotunnel.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,trycloudflare.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,imagedelivery.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,videodelivery.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloudflarestream.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cdn.cloudflare.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,one.one.one.one

# Cloudflare standard resolver IP literals, including HTTPS /cdn-cgi/trace.
# Exact hosts only; no-resolve avoids resolving unrelated domains for these rules.
# Source: https://developers.cloudflare.com/1.1.1.1/ip-addresses/
IP-CIDR,1.1.1.1/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,1.0.0.1/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2606:4700:4700::1111/128,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2606:4700:4700::1001/128,no-resolve

